# Generated-upstream-file guardrail. The daily sync may clear a conflict to
# upstream when every conflicted path is an upstream-CI-generated tree AND these
# checks prove none of them carry fork-owned content. Deleting either script
# silently removes that proof and turns the sync shortcut into blind data loss.
# Note the marker for the list is its `generated-by:` sentinel, not a path:
# `distribution/preview.json` also appears in docs/preview/README.md, and using
# it would make the generated-file guardrail reject that upstream-authored file.
